Create a root-level .gitignore for this project.

This project is a browser-based Todo application with an Agentic SDLC using Claude, Atlassian MCP, and GitHub.

Exclude only:
- .env files and environment secrets
- OS-specific files
- editor/IDE temporary files
- Node/npm generated files if they appear
- Python cache files
- test/cache artifacts
- local authentication or credential files

Do NOT exclude any project files or Agentic SDLC files.

The following must remain tracked:
- .claude/agents/
- .claude/prompts/
- .claude/skills/
- .claude/hooks/
- CLAUDE.md
- docs/
- todo-app/
- requirements.md
- architecture.md
- design-review.md
- impl-plan.md
- code-review.md
- verification.md
- PR.md
- CHANGELOG.md

Keep the .gitignore minimal.

After creating it, read it and show me its complete contents.
Do not run git add, git commit, or git push.